    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents this most attractive, two bedroom, two bathroom apartment boasting a light filled interior thanks a to a south facing aspect, also benefitting from a designated underground parking space. Situated in the popular and well maintained Charlotte Quay Dock which is superbly located adjacent to Grand Canal Dock and a host of amenities as well as large employers like Google and State Street Bank on the doorstep. Presented in excellent decorative condition, the interior briefly comprises entrance hallway with storage, bay windowed kitchen/ living room with pleasant views, fully equipped kitchen, two double bedrooms with master en-suite and a bathroom.\r\n\r\nMust be viewed to be appreciated!\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nA short walk from Grand Canal Dock DART station Location this is a vibrant location on the doorstep of the city centre with an abundance of cafés, restaurants and bars on offer. The area is well served by local bus routes and Grand Canal Dock DART station on Barrow Street is a five minute walk away. Some of Dublin finest entertainment attractions are all within walking distance including The Bord Gais Energy Theatre, the Aviva stadium and the Convention Centre Dublin. Dublin's premier shops on Grafton Street, St Stephen's Green and Trinity College Dublin are all within strolling distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious two bed, two bath apartment.\r\nSuperb Dublin 4 location.\r\nSouth facing aspect.\r\nAttractive resident’s courtyard/gardens.\r\nViews of the Dublin Mountains and Aviva Stadium.\r\nParking space available.\r\nAmple storage space.\r\nConvenient to the city centre.\r\nA short walk from Grand Canal Dock DART station."
      }
    ],
